  "title": "Взять след",
  "prompt": "One deliberate scent-tracking ability gesture, larger and clearer than quiet idle sniffing. Lower the broad muzzle almost to the ground, sweep it slowly from near the planted free claw toward screen right, pause for two clear short sniffs, then tilt one torn ear as if locating a smell. Draw the muzzle back and settle into the exact original crouch. The torso follows in a low compact arc; the club stays tucked across the belly. No bite, strike, weapon swing, target, projectile or magic effect. Keep both short feet planted at the same spot and the spine deeply hunched, never stand taller or turn around. Preserve the small body size, simple pixel clusters and torn clothing. Fixed camera and scale, transparent background, whole figure and club within the canvas with empty edge margins.",
